  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.0 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Other changes\n* ci: attest and sign only the wheel and sdist by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/156\n* ci: keep the snapshot report when a test job fails by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/157\n* build(deps): bump pyasn1 to 0.6.5 and msgpack to 1.2.4 by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/166\n* Self-hosted badges, hardened checkouts, SECURITY.md by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/165\n* chore: relicense under MIT by @alDuncanson in https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/pull/167\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/alDuncanson/Handler/compare/v0.4.0...v0.5.0",
